---
// Post 9 figure (margin trading): SbP09ForcedSaleLoop
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
---
<figure class="sbp9-loop">
  <div class="scroll">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 900 290" role="img" aria-label="A loop in four steps: price falls; account ratios drop under the call and force-sell lines; the broker sells the pledged shares; sell orders pile up with few buyers at the floor, and the price falls again.">
      <text x="20" y="28" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>The loop that turns many small calls into one sell-off</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Vòng lặp biến nhiều lệnh gọi nhỏ thành một đợt bán tháo</tspan></text><rect x="40" y="50" width="300" height="76" rx="10" class="box"/><DiagramIcon name="chart" x={68} y={88} size={24} /><text x="96" y="82" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Price falls, maybe to the floor</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Giá giảm, có thể nằm sàn</tspan></text><text x="96" y="102" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>Every holder loses at once</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Mọi người nắm giữ cùng thua</tspan></text><rect x="560" y="50" width="300" height="76" rx="10" class="boxg"/><DiagramIcon name="warning" x={588} y={88} size={24} /><text x="616" y="82" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Ratios drop under 35% / 30%</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Tỷ lệ xuống dưới 35% / 30%</tspan></text><text x="616" y="102" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>Calls go out, then sales</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Gọi ký quỹ, rồi bán</tspan></text><rect x="560" y="190" width="300" height="76" rx="10" class="boxr"/><DiagramIcon name="bank" x={588} y={228} size={24} /><text x="616" y="222" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Broker sells your shares</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Công ty chứng khoán bán cổ phiếu</tspan></text><text x="616" y="242" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>Market sell orders, your price not chosen</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Lệnh bán thị trường, bạn không chọn giá</tspan></text><rect x="40" y="190" width="300" height="76" rx="10" class="box"/><DiagramIcon name="users" x={68} y={228} size={24} /><text x="96" y="222" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Sell orders pile up</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Lệnh bán chất đống</tspan></text><text x="96" y="242" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>Few buyers at the floor</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Ít người mua ở giá sàn</tspan></text><line x1="340" y1="88" x2="552" y2="88" class="ln"/><polygon points="560,88 551,83 551,93" class="ah"/><line x1="710" y1="126" x2="710" y2="182" class="ln"/><polygon points="710,190 705,181 715,181" class="ah"/><line x1="560" y1="228" x2="348" y2="228" class="ln"/><polygon points="340,228 349,223 349,233" class="ah"/><line x1="190" y1="190" x2="190" y2="134" class="ln"/><polygon points="190,126 185,135 195,135" class="ah"/><text x="450" y="158" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Same lines, same week: the loop repeats</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Cùng đường, cùng tuần: vòng lặp lặp lại</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Forced sales are ordinary sell orders. They add to the supply that pushed the price down.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Bán giải chấp chỉ là lệnh bán bình thường. Nó cộng thêm vào nguồn cung đã kéo giá xuống.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .sbp9-loop { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .sbp9-loop .scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .sbp9-loop svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .sbp9-loop text { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .sbp9-loop .h { font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp9-loop .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp9-loop .m { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .sbp9-loop .r { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .sbp9-loop .g { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--act-1); }
  .sbp9-loop .ok { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--act-2); }
  .sbp9-loop .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .sbp9-loop .boxr { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .sbp9-loop .boxg { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .sbp9-loop .boxok { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--act-2); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .sbp9-loop .fdebt { fill: var(--border); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1; }
  .sbp9-loop .feq { fill: var(--act-2); fill-opacity: 0.85; }
  .sbp9-loop .feqr { fill: var(--red); fill-opacity: 0.85; }
  .sbp9-loop .fgold { fill: var(--gold); fill-opacity: 0.9; }
  .sbp9-loop .fgray { fill: var(--text-muted); fill-opacity: 0.55; }
  .sbp9-loop .wh { fill: var(--bg); }
  .sbp9-loop .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.8; fill: none; }
  .sbp9-loop .lnr { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; stroke-dasharray: 6 4; fill: none; }
  .sbp9-loop .lng { stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.8; stroke-dasharray: 6 4; fill: none; }
  .sbp9-loop .axis { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .sbp9-loop .ah { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .sbp9-loop .dotr { fill: var(--red); } .sbp9-loop .dotg { fill: var(--gold); } .sbp9-loop .dotk { fill: var(--act-2); }
  .sbp9-loop figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
